# state: first-run   (recorded on a disk with no save for the title (NOTES.md E); lane.savestate433)
# Dead or Alive 3 (4D53002D), Thor. One file: DOA3 has no profile on the
# way to a fight.
#
# Evidence:
# - pass 1 (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-doa3, Thor, COLD shader cache):
#   the copyright warning scrolled at 3-14 fps to t~200, TECMO logo t~206,
#   "PRESS START BUTTON" at t~305; START and A every ~6 s did not skip the
#   warning, and A does not pass the title prompt.
# - screening soak 1790801641-titleroutes-1213635 (Thor, WARM cache, this
#   route's first version, which waited 300 s blind): by t100 the attract
#   demo was already running (warning100: fight at the pagoda stage; t200
#   a newspaper cutscene at 46 fps; t260 a fight at 54 fps). The Thor's
#   screening runner stopped it at xo 70 C at 284 s, before the first press.
#   So with a warm cache the title is reachable well before t90.
#
# So: START twice from t~75 (attract -> title prompt -> main menu; if the
# first START lands on the prompt, the second enters the menu's first item),
# then A to walk STORY -> character select -> costume -> fight intro. Extra
# A presses in the fight are attacks, so over-pressing is safe; START is not
# pressed after the menu (it pauses the fight). The menu steps are
# [recalled]; every step leaves a frame.
#
# NOT YET REPLAYED -- a Thor screening soak is its validation (no
# interactive Thor session while the fan is dead).
wait 60
shot boot60
wait 15
shot boot75                 # expect attract or PRESS START BUTTON
press START
wait 4
shot after-start1
press START
wait 4
shot after-start2           # [recalled] main menu, STORY first
mark booted
repeat 7 {
    press A                 # STORY -> fighter -> costume -> skip the intro poses
    wait 4
    shot menu-a
}
wait 4
shot round
mark gameplay               # [guess] the round start (timer running)
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 0.6
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press Y
    wait 0.3
    press X
    wait 0.3
    axis LX mid
    press B
    wait 0.3
    press A                 # also leaves a KO / continue screen
    wait 0.3
}
